          <attvalue for="34" value="0.7" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Broad sanctions and export restrictions raise compliance and sanctions‑risk for banks, investors and cloud providers, causing them to withdraw, delay, or redirect capital away from affected AI infrastructure projects." />
