          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Intensified regulatory scrutiny (export controls and operational oversight) reduces legal and illicit transfer of dual‑use AI maritime systems to Iranian proxies and increases insurer and carrier confidence, leading to fewer interruptions and thus higher regional oil export flows." />
