          <attvalue for="34" value="0.7" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Sustained spikes and volatility in global oil prices quickly increase Russian hydrocarbon revenues and fiscal headroom, enabling faster hiring, contract‑soldier payments, weapons procurement and logistical sustainment that raise mobilisation levels." />
