          <attvalue for="35" value="Heightened fears of conflict and cross‑border disruption prompt allied governments and strategic investors to accelerate and expand capital deployment into onshore and allied‑region AI infrastructure (data centres, localized cloud, fabs) to reduce dependence on exposed supply chains." />
