          <attvalue for="34" value="0.8" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="A rise in perceived escalation triggers a near-term flight-to-quality as investors shift allocations from equities and risky assets into sovereign bonds and high-grade fixed-income vehicles, producing net inflows into fixed-income products." />
