          <attvalue for="28" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Rising long‑term sovereign yields increase the cost of capital and lower valuations for multi‑year projects, causing multinational firms to scale back investment, joint ventures, and high‑visibility engagement in China, reducing corporate diplomatic interaction." />
