          <attvalue for="28" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="An upward revision in expected short‑term policy rates raises the projected fiscal cost of new spending and debt servicing for NATO and EU states, prompting budget conservatism that slows procurement and troop sustainment efforts tied to defence mobilisation." />
