          <attvalue for="34" value="0.65" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Greater bond market liquidity reduces the likelihood of sudden repricing and forced sales that propagate through margining and asset managers, thereby lowering the strength of feedbacks between financial stress events and critical AI infrastructure/providers (i.e., less liquidity → stronger coupling, so the causal sign is negative)." />
